An '''overload (-)''' is a potion that boosts all the player's combat stats by 4 + 10%, while damaging them for 50 [[hitpoints]]. This boost is repeated every 15 seconds for five minutes until the effects wear off, and the player is then healed 50 hitpoints.

It can only be made in the [[Chambers of Xeric]] with 60 to 75 [[Herblore]] by using a [[noxifer]] with any variant of an [[elder potion]], [[twisted potion]], and [[kodai potion]].

This potion is the weakest variant of the overload potions, and cannot be taken out of the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. The [[Overload (Chambers of Xeric)|standard variant]] requires the regular secondary potions, and 75 Herblore, whilst the [[Overload (+)|strongest variant]] requires the strongest secondary potions, and 90 Herblore.

==Effects==
Boosts to most combat skills is calculated with: <math>\lfloor SkillLevel \times \frac{1}{10} \rfloor + 4</math>
